    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19394" root="سدو and سدى" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَدْوٌ</span></b>  inf. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَدَا</span>. (S, M, K.) Hence, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَدَا</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَدْوَ كَذا</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَسْدُو سَدْوَ كَذَا</span>: see 1. And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَطَبَ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الأَمِيرُ فَمَا زَالَ عَلَى سَدْوٍ وَاحِدٍ</span> i. e. [<i>The prince,</i> or
<i>commander, recited an oration,</i> or <i>a harangue,</i>
&amp;c., <i>and ceased not to keep to</i>] <i>one proserhyme.</i> (M.)

